// Name: Rare Process Execution
// Description: Identifies rare process names by device population.
// Query Type: Hunting
// Platforms: Microsoft Defender XDR Advanced Hunting
// Tables: DeviceProcessEvents
// Required Connectors: Microsoft Defender XDR
// MITRE ATT&CK: Varies by process behavior
// Severity: Informational
// Lookback: 7d
// Entity Fields: DeviceName, FileName
// False Positives: Newly deployed software or low-population administration tools
// Tuning Guidance: Add prevalence baselines, signer context, hashes, and known-good exclusions
// Response Guidance: Review file reputation, parent process, command line, and network activity
// Validation Status: Example
// Related Analytics Rule: None

DeviceProcessEvents
| where Timestamp > ago(7d)
| summarize DeviceCount=dcount(DeviceName), ExecutionCount=count(), Devices=make_set(DeviceName, 50)
    by FileName, FolderPath
| where DeviceCount <= 3 and ExecutionCount <= 10
| order by DeviceCount asc, ExecutionCount asc
